it gap[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]Every research-macro report lands in a checkout the host commits. A[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]run that writes into a checkout the commit finalizer does not scan [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]is told so before it stops. The ten reports already stranded in [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]apollo's primary research checkouts get committed.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]2[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]research_commit_gap.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/research_commit_gap.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-1tj[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-1tj/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Resolve research paths at agent run time[/bold #D7AFFF]                      [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]research-macro-paths[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]research-macro-paths: make the five research macros resolve the research[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]checkout through an agent-run sase repo open research instead of a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]launch-time sase repo path substitution; update docs, add a regression [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]test, and note the general launch-time cwd hazard.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Flag writes the commit finalizer cannot see[/bold #D7AFFF]                   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]unscanned-write-guard[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]unscanned-write-guard: add a shared detector for run writes and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]registered artifact sources that sit i